#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management/paintoppresets.rst:16
msgid "Brush Preset"
msgstr "Préréglages de brosse"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management/paintoppresets.rst:18
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Paint Op presets store the preview thumbnail, brush-engine, the "
#| "parameters, the brush tip, and, if possible, the texture. They are saved "
#| "as .kpp files."
msgid ""
"Brush Presets, known within Krita as ``paintoppresets``, store the preview "
"thumbnail, brush-engine, the parameters, the brush tip, and, if possible, "
"the texture. They are saved as ``.kpp`` files, except for :ref:`MyPaint "
"brushes <mypaint_brush_engine>`, which are saved as ``.myb`` files."
msgstr ""
"Les préréglages de « Paintop » enregistre les vignettes d'aperçu, le moteur "
"de brosse, les paramètres, les astuces de brosse et lorsque possible, la "
"texture. Ils sont enregistrés dans des fichiers « .kpp »."

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management/paintoppresets.rst:20
msgid ""
"For information regarding the brush system, see :ref:`Brushes "
"<loading_saving_brushes>`."
msgstr ""
"Pour plus d'informations concernant le système des brosses, veuillez "
"consulter :ref:`Brosses <loading_saving_brushes>`."

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management/paintoppresets.rst:23
msgid "The Docker"
msgstr "Le panneau"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management/paintoppresets.rst:25
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The docker for Paint-op presets is the :ref:`brush_preset_docker`. Here "
#| "you can tag, add, remove and search paint op presets."
msgid ""
"The docker for Paint-op presets is the :ref:`brush_preset_docker`. Here you "
"can tag, add, remove and search brush presets."
msgstr ""
"Le panneau des préréglages de « Paintop » est :ref:`brush_preset_docker`. "
"Ici, vous pouvez étiqueter, ajouter, supprimer et rechercher des préréglages "
"de « Paintop »."

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management/paintoppresets.rst:28
msgid "Editing the preview thumbnail"
msgstr "Modification en cours de la vignette d'aperçu"

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management/paintoppresets.rst:30
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "You can edit the preview thumbnail in the brush-scratchpad, but you can "
#| "also open the \\*.kpp file in Krita to get a 200x200 file to edit to your "
#| "wishes."
msgid ""
"You can edit the preview thumbnail in the brush-scratchpad, but you can also "
"open the ``\\*.kpp`` file in Krita to get a 200x200 file to edit to your "
"wishes. For :ref:`MyPaint brushes <mypaint_brush_engine>`, there is a "
"separate PNG file which is the same name as the ``.myb`` file, except with "
"``_prev`` attached."
msgstr ""
"Vous pouvez modifier la vignette d'aperçu dans la zone de brouillon de "
"brosses. Mais, vous pouvez aussi ouvrir un fichier « \\*.kpp » dans Krita "
"pour obtenir un fichier 200 x 200 pour réaliser les modifications de votre "
"choix."

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management/paintoppresets.rst:33
msgid "Structure"
msgstr ""

#: ../../reference_manual/resource_management/paintoppresets.rst:35
msgid ""
":ref:`MyPaint brushes <mypaint_brush_engine>` are stored as JSON files with "
"an accompanying preview image, while ``.kpp`` files are PNGs which contain "
"an annotation with the XML data for the brush engine. You can view this data "
"when having the ``.kpp`` file open, via :menuselection:`image --> properties "
"--> annotations`, or by using the :program:`ImageMagick` command ``identify -"
"verbose {FILENAME}`` on the ``.kpp``."
msgstr ""
